## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema100 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double sar = iSAR(NULL,PERIOD_M5,0.01,0.01,1)` — note slow step (0.01) and max (0.01)
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_M5,64,128,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)` — non-standard periods
- LONG: `iClose[1] > ema100 && sar < iLow[1] && macd > 0`
- SL: `iSAR(NULL,PERIOD_M5,0.01,0.01,0) - 3*pip` for long
- TP: `entry + 2*(entry - sl_price)` (2:1 R/R, QM-added)
- P3 sweeps: SAR step (0.01/0.02), MACD periods (64,128 vs 12,26), EMA period (50/100/200), TP ratio (1.5R/2R/3R)

